
/* <%= @marker %>: the EmpoweredHouse design system, this application's default look. Its
   tokens, their Tailwind utilities (bg-surface-1, text-fg-secondary, border-line-faint, …), one
   daisyUI theme made of them, and its fonts, which the endpoint serves. Override a token at the
   end of this file. For a look of your own, remove the import below and keep this comment, which
   tells ehos_app's installer not to add it back; then turn daisyUI's themes back on, remove the
   endpoint's Plug.Static for ehos_design, the two font preloads in the root layout and the
   dependency, and delete the page at /design-system, if there is one, which shows the design
   system. */
@import "<%= @design_system_css %>";
/* The design system's components (EhosDesign.Components) render utilities of their own, which
   Tailwind finds in their templates. */
@source "<%= @design_system_lib %>";
